        <object label="&lt;b&gt;CANDIDATE FUNNEL — every knob, in constructor order&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;1 bm25TopK 20 · 2 vectorTopK 20 — candidates&lt;br&gt;3 fusionTopK 15 — survive RRF · 5 rrfK 60&lt;br&gt;4 rerankerTopK 5 — reach the answer prompt&lt;br&gt;6 llmCall null · 7 rerankerMode &#x27;heuristic&#x27;&lt;br&gt;every one is options.X || literal — no config file, no env&lt;br&gt;20+20 → 15 → 5, applied at" class="card.invariant" id="card_funnel">
