        <object label="&lt;b&gt;SILENT DEGRADATIONS ON THE QUERY PATH — in call order&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;1 bm25.search: query tokenizes to nothing → [] bm25.js&lt;br&gt;2 cosineSimilarity: either norm 0 → 0 vectorSearch.js&lt;br&gt;3 rerank: no candidates → [] reranker.js&lt;br&gt;4 LLM JSON unparseable → heuristic; console.warn only&lt;br&gt;5 candidate absent from LLM scores → rerankerScore 0&lt;br&gt;6 no llmCall → mockGenerateAnswer pipeline.js&lt;br&gt;7 zero chunks → fixed &#x27;not found&#x27; string — see below" class="card.failure" id="card_degrade">
          <mxCell style="rounded=1;fillColor=#FFEBEE;strokeColor=#C62828;fontSize=8;fontColor=#232F3E;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;spacingLeft=6;opacity=70;" parent="1" vertex="1">
